{
  "content": "<h1><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"NumberCustomFields\">Number Custom Fields</span></h1><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Custom CustomField CustomFields NumberCustomFields To ToDate\">Number custom fields capture numerical data like quantities, measurements, scores, or ratings.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Add Automatic Item Line On To ToDate Total\">Number fields on line items automatically calculate totals, making them perfect for tracking additional quantities.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Business Hours On To ToDate\">Use them for weights, dimensions, hours, units, or any measurable values specific to your business.</p><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Name\">Name</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Name\">Name</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Custom CustomField Is Name On To ToDate\">The name of each <em>number custom field</em> as displayed on forms.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Hours Name\">Include units in the name when applicable, like 'Weight (kg)' or 'Hours Worked'.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Placement\">Placement</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Placement\">Placement</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Is\">Shows which forms include this <em>number field</em>.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Item Line On To ToDate Total\">Number fields on <em>line items</em> will show totals; fields on headers capture single values.</p></div></details>",
  "key": "number-custom-fields"
}
